* SELECTION-SCREEN
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK1 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S01.
  "향후 권한 연동하여 User별 Defalut 값 관리시 Display 필드로 변경(WERKS)
  "[임시]S_MATNR: 필수지정. 추후 자재유형 조건 추가할 듯.
  "현재 로직은.. P_USE에 해당하는 것만.. 추후 P_EXP 관련 로직 추가되면 로직 분기필요!
  PARAMETERS     : P_WERKS LIKE T001W-WERKS OBLIGATORY.
  SELECT-OPTIONS : S_MATNR  FOR MARA-MATNR,"OBLIGATORY,
                   S_BUDAT  FOR MKPF-BUDAT  OBLIGATORY NO-EXTENSION
                                            MODIF ID CAL.
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK1.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK2 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S02.
  PARAMETERS     : P_SALK3 TYPE CHAR18. "LIKE MBEW-SALK3.
  SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 52(15) GV_SALK3.
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK2.

