    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R01 FOR FIELD P_ALL.

    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 32.
    PARAMETERS : P_USE RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR1 DEFAULT 'X'.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R02 FOR FIELD P_USE.

    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 64.
    PARAMETERS : P_EXP RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR1.
